# Waivers for the image gates in .github/workflows/ci-cd.yml. One CVE per line,
# each with why it is waived and what lifts it.

# fastmcp 2.13.3 in the okta-mcp-server uv tool venv (mcp-packages/uv-tools.txt).
# okta-mcp-server pins fastmcp==2.13.3 exactly and has no later release; the fix
# is fastmcp 3.2.0. The flaw is in FastMCP's OpenAPI integration, which okta_mcp
# never imports. Drop this line when the okta pin moves past fastmcp 3.2.0.
CVE-2026-32871

# Go stdlib 1.26.4 in restic 0.19.1 (Dockerfile.backend), the latest release;
# the fix is Go 1.26.9. The flaw is os.Root following junctions on Windows, and
# this image is Linux only. Drop this line when restic ships on Go 1.26.9+.
CVE-2026-56857
